    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "In a rectangular prism $ABCDEFGH$, $AB = 12$ cm and $BC = 5$ cm. The height of the prism is 8 cm.\n(a) Find the length of the diagonal $AC$ on the base. (3 marks)\n(b) Find the length of the space diagonal $AG$. (3 marks)\n(c) Find the angle between the diagonal $AG$ and the base $ABCD$, correct to the nearest degree. (5 marks)",
    "question_zh": "在一長方體 $ABCDEFGH$ 中，$AB = 12$ cm 及 $BC = 5$ cm。長方體的高為 8 cm。\n(a) 求底面對角線 $AC$ 的長度。(3分)\n(b) 求空間對角線 $AG$ 的長度。(3分)\n(c) 求對角線 $AG$ 與底面 $ABCD$ 之間的夾角（準確至最接近的度）。(5分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) In $\\triangle ABC$, $AC = \\sqrt{12^2 + 5^2} = \\sqrt{169} = 13$ cm.",
      "(b) In $\\triangle ACG$, where $GC = 8$, $AG = \\sqrt{13^2 + 8^2} = \\sqrt{233} \\approx 15.26$ cm.",
      "(c) Let $\\theta$ be the angle $\\angle GAC$. $\\tan \\theta = \\frac{GC}{AC} = \\frac{8}{13}$.",
      " $\\theta = \\tan^{-1}(\\frac{8}{13}) \\approx 31.6^\\circ$. To the nearest degree, $\\theta = 32^\\circ$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) 在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，$AC = \\sqrt{12^2 + 5^2} = 13$ cm。",
      "(b) 在 $\\triangle ACG$ 中，$GC = 8$。$AG = \\sqrt{13^2 + 8^2} = \\sqrt{233} \\approx 15.26$ cm。",
      "(c) 設 $\\theta$ 為 $\\angle GAC$。$\\tan \\theta = \\frac{8}{13}$。",
      " $\\theta = \\tan^{-1}(\\frac{8}{13}) \\approx 31.6^\\circ$。準確至整數：$32^\\circ$。"
    ],
