    "question_en": "The box-and-whisker plot below shows the distribution of scores in a test.\n(a) Find the range of the scores. (2 marks)\n(b) Find the interquartile range (IQR). (3 marks)\n(c) If the passing score is 45, what is the percentage of students who passed the test? (6 marks)",
    "question_zh": "下方的箱形圖顯示了一次測試的分數分佈。\n(a) 求分數的全距。(2分)\n(b) 求四分位距 (IQR)。(3分)\n(c) 若合格分數為 45，則合格學生佔總人數的百分之幾？(6分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) Range $= \\text{Max} - \\text{Min} = 90 - 10 = 80$.",
      "(b) IQR $= Q_3 - Q_1 = 60 - 30 = 30$.",
      "(c) The score 45 corresponds to the Median ($Q_2$).",
      " In a box plot, 50% of the data lies above the median.",
      " Percentage of students who passed $= 50\\%$."
    ],
