  {
    "id": "ct_sa_299",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_polynomials"],
    "marks": 12,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "Let $f(x) = 2x^3 - kx^2 + 5x - 4$. It is given that $x - 2$ is a factor of $f(x)$.\n(a) Find the value of $k$. (4 marks)\n(b) Find the remainder when $f(x)$ is divided by $2x + 1$. (8 marks)",
    "question_zh": "設 $f(x) = 2x^3 - kx^2 + 5x - 4$。已知 $x - 2$ 是 $f(x)$ 的因式。\n(a) 求 $k$ 的值。(4分)\n(b) 當 $f(x)$ 除以 $2x + 1$ 時，求餘數。(8分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) Since $x - 2$ is a factor, $f(2) = 0$.",
      " $2(2^3) - k(2^2) + 5(2) - 4 = 16 - 4k + 10 - 4 = 22 - 4k$.",
      " $22 - 4k = 0 \\implies k = 5.5$.",
      "(b) Remainder $= f(-0.5)$.",
      " $f(-0.5) = 2(-0.5)^3 - 5.5(-0.5)^2 + 5(-0.5) - 4$.",
      " $= 2(-0.125) - 5.5(0.25) - 2.5 - 4 = -0.25 - 1.375 - 2.5 - 4 = -8.125$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) 由於 $x - 2$ 是因式，$f(2) = 0$。",
      " $2(8) - k(4) + 10 - 4 = 22 - 4k = 0 \\implies k = 5.5$。",
      "(b) 餘數 $= f(-0.5)$。",
      " $f(-0.5) = 2(-0.125) - 5.5(0.25) - 2.5 - 4 = -8.125$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["remainder-theorem", "factor-theorem"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_300",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_inequalities"],
    "marks": 13,
    "difficulty": 8,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "Maximize $P = 40x + 25y$ subject to the following constraints:\n$x + y \\le 10$\n$2x + y \\le 14$\n$x \\ge 0, y \\ge 0$",
    "question_zh": "在以下限制條件下，最大化 $P = 40x + 25y$：\n$x + y \\le 10$\n$2x + y \\le 14$\n$x \\ge 0, y \\ge 0$",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Find the vertices of the feasible region:",
      "1. Intersection of $x+y=10$ and $2x+y=14$: Subtracting eqns: $x = 4$. Then $4+y=10 \\implies y=6$. Point: $(4, 6)$.",
      "2. Intersections with axes: $(0, 10)$, $(7, 0)$, $(0, 0)$.",
      "Check values of $P$ at each vertex:",
      "$(0, 0) \\Rightarrow P = 0$.",
      "$(7, 0) \\Rightarrow P = 40(7) + 25(0) = 280$.",
      "$(0, 10) \\Rightarrow P = 40(0) + 25(10) = 250$.",
      "$(4, 6) \\Rightarrow P = 40(4) + 25(6) = 160 + 150 = 310$.",
      "The maximum value is 310 at $(4, 6)$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "尋找可行解區域的頂點：",
      "1. $x+y=10$ 與 $2x+y=14$ 的交點：相減得 $x=4$。代入得 $4+y=10 \\implies y=6$。頂點：$(4, 6)$。",
      "2. 與軸的交點：$(0, 10)$、$(7, 0)$及$(0, 0)$。",
      "計算各頂點的 $P$ 值：",
      "$(0, 0) \\Rightarrow P = 0$。",
      "$(7, 0) \\Rightarrow P = 280$。",
      "$(0, 10) \\Rightarrow P = 250$。",
      "$(4, 6) \\Rightarrow P = 310$。",
      "最大值為 310，於 $(4, 6)$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["linear-programming", "optimization"],
    "status": "approved"
  }
]
